---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Quickstart">
  <h1>Quickstart Guide</h1>
  <p>Get up and running with SwirlDB in minutes.</p>

  <section>
    <h2>Installation</h2>
    <p>SwirlDB is available as both a browser WASM package and a TypeScript wrapper.</p>

    <h3>Browser (WASM + TypeScript)</h3>
    <pre><code>{`npm install @swirldb/js
# or
yarn add @swirldb/js`}</code></pre>

    <h3>Build from Source</h3>
    <pre><code>{`# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/your-org/swirldb.git
cd swirldb

# Build WASM
cd native/swirldb-core
wasm-pack build --target web --features wasm
cd ../..

# Build TypeScript wrapper
cd packages/swirldb-js
npm install
npm run build`}</code></pre>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Basic Usage</h2>

    <h3>1. Import and Initialize</h3>
    <pre><code>{`import init, { SwirlDB as WasmDB } from '@swirldb/browser-wasm';
import { SwirlDB } from '@swirldb/js';

// Initialize WASM
await init();

// Create database (memory-only)
const db = new SwirlDB(new WasmDB());`}</code></pre>

    <h3>2. Set and Get Values</h3>
    <pre><code>{`// Set values using native property access
db.data.user.name = 'Alice';
db.data.user.age = 30;
db.data.user.email = 'alice@example.com';

// Get values with .$value
console.log(db.data.user.name.$value); // 'Alice'
console.log(db.data.user.age.$value);  // 30`}</code></pre>

    <h3>3. Nested Objects</h3>
    <pre><code>{`// Deep nested paths are created automatically
db.data.app.settings.theme.mode = 'dark';
db.data.app.settings.theme.primaryColor = '#667eea';

// Access nested values
const mode = db.data.app.settings.theme.mode.$value;
console.log(mode); // 'dark'`}</code></pre>

    <h3>4. Observers</h3>
    <pre><code>{`// Watch for changes
db.data.user.name.$observe((newValue) => {
  console.log('Name changed to:', newValue);
});

// This will trigger the observer
db.data.user.name = 'Bob'; // Logs: "Name changed to: Bob"`}</code></pre>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Persistence</h2>

    <h3>LocalStorage</h3>
    <pre><code>{`// Create database with LocalStorage persistence
const db = await SwirlDB.withLocalStorage('my-app-db');

// Data is automatically loaded from storage on creation
console.log(db.data.user.name.$value);

// Manually persist
db.persist();

// Enable auto-persistence (debounced)
db.enableAutoPersist(500); // 500ms debounce
db.data.count = 42; // Auto-saves after 500ms

// Disable auto-persistence
db.disableAutoPersist();`}</code></pre>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Storage Hints</h2>
    <p>Control which paths are persisted with storage hints:</p>

    <pre><code>{`// Memory-only: Never persisted
db.setStorageHint('session.temp', 'memory-only');
db.data.session.temp = 'temporary';

// Persisted: Saved to storage adapter
db.setStorageHint('user.profile', 'persisted');
db.data.user.profile = { bio: 'Developer' };

// Synced: Future - will sync with remote
db.setStorageHint('shared.doc', 'synced');
db.data.shared.doc = 'Collaborative content';`}</code></pre>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Scoped Proxies</h2>
    <p>Get a proxy scoped to a specific path for cleaner code:</p>

    <pre><code>{`// Get a scoped proxy
const user = db.at('user');

// Set multiple fields
user.name = 'Alice';
user.email = 'alice@example.com';
user.age = 30;

// Read values
console.log(user.name.$value); // 'Alice'`}</code></pre>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Batch Operations</h2>
    <p>Group multiple mutations and check observers once:</p>

    <pre><code>{`db.batch((db) => {
  for (let i = 0; i < 100; i++) {
    db.data.items[\`item\${i}\`] = { id: i, value: Math.random() };
  }
});
// Observers fire once after batch completes`}</code></pre>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>State Management</h2>

    <h3>Save State</h3>
    <pre><code>{`// Save entire state to Uint8Array
const state = db.saveState();

// Store in localStorage
localStorage.setItem('db-backup', btoa(String.fromCharCode(...state)));`}</code></pre>

    <h3>Load State</h3>
    <pre><code>{`// Load from Uint8Array
const saved = localStorage.getItem('db-backup');
if (saved) {
  const bytes = Uint8Array.from(atob(saved), c => c.charCodeAt(0));
  db.loadState(bytes);
}`}</code></pre>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Next Steps</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/proxy-api">Learn about the Proxy API</a></li>
      <li><a href="/storage">Explore storage adapters</a></li>
      <li><a href="/examples">View interactive examples</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  h2 {
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  h3 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }

  pre {
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  ul li {
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  ul li a {
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  ul li a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
